# Universal Git Ignore Rule

# Node & React
**/node_modules/
**/node_modules
node_modules/
**/dist/
**/build/

# Python & Django
**/venv/
**/env/
**/ENV/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/*.sqlite3
**/*.db
**/.env

# Logs & Temporary Files
**/*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*

# IDE & OS Metadata
**/.vscode/
**/.idea/
**/.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
**/*.zip
